</span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT">(l’Artiglio
dell’Ovest)</span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT">
</span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT">mostra
