<h3 class="western" align="justify"><a name="__RefHeading___Toc45820_4016214929"></a>
●  I venti del Giravàgo</h3>
<p align="justify" style="line-height: 100%; margin-bottom: 0cm"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt">Sinossi
(parziale)  by : Zeta’ (‘Citicispo’), Zeta” (‘Dæmonya’),
‘Vì’, Pàncer (‘Doréamon’), Q” (‘Vixykatt’)</font></p>
<p align="justify"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt">Parole :
