modo da impedire tutti i trasporti da / alla superficie, sino a
revoca dell’</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">o</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">rdine.
Ruba un incrociatore volante e, con pochi fedeli, fugge in un deserto
nel Granducato di Ehremzùllen, </span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">senza
bene sapere come arginare quel flagello imprevisto</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">.</span></span></span></span></font></span></font></font></p>
<p align="justify" style="margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: 115%"><font size="2" style="font-size: 10pt"><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">Zvìrren
frattanto, dopo la misteriosa scomparsa di Llyrahl, </span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">si
