</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">Maestro</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">.
Chiede aiuto a Reyden, che le faccia da mediatrice, non avendo
Zvìrren alcuna dote Esegetica ed accesso al Mormorio. La Jahwrusa
collabora, per espiare l</span></span></span></span></font></span></font><font color="#000000"><span style="text-decoration: none"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span style="letter-spacing: normal"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">a
