sono di natura eterogenea : politica, ispirate al degrado morale e</span></span></span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">d</span></span></span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">
al declino </span></span></span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">cognitivo
ed </span></span></span></font></font><font color="#000000"><font face="Times New Roman, serif"><span lang="it-IT"><span style="font-style: normal"><span style="font-weight: normal">istituzionale
del “paese”, ambientali (ecologiste, antispeciste). Nota a
